class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>","enumerator":"1","key":"M4y0DM0iil"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"因此，地震图包含了震源、结构以及仪器的信息。地震学科研工作者正是通过解读地震图，\n得到相关信息的。一般而言，仪器项（即仪器响应）已知，所以地震图通常用于反演震源和\n结构信息。其中，结构项一般称为格林函数，只与地球内部结构有关。","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"Th4IwyIerY"}],"key":"g0tyaP7YGj"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":28,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"地震图与元数据（metadata）共同构成了完备的地震学观测数据。\n元数据包含与地震图相关的重要信息，如台站位置、仪器响应等。","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"UuIMF75CC0"}],"key":"q7jxYK6TJT"},{"type":"container","kind":"figure","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/seismology101/build/seismic-waveform-8f4f9229ae48b2a7ca3fa222694e2e20.png","alt":"\"体波和面波的波形和传播路径实例\"","width":"95%","align":"center","key":"ZRwRwExpcO","urlSource":"seismic-waveform.png"},{"type":"caption","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":37,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"体波和面波的波形和传播路径实例。\n引自《[An Introduction to Seismology, Earthquakes, and Earth Structure]》\n图 1.1-3。","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":35,"column":1}},"key":"DjeQZF5ZLd"}],"key":"uGSuoQx1Dx"}],"key":"dRcOkV0YjA"}],"enumerator":"1","key":"Q7ZXEGmBKJ"}],"key":"l3FrO7tPVU"}],"key":"LuaHK6jy0x"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"地震震相","url":"/seismology/seismic-phase","group":"地震学基础"},"next":{"title":"地震仪","u